WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.481
Oh good!

00:00:01.482 --> 00:00:03.421
You can help me decide what to wear.

00:00:03.468 --> 00:00:07.798
I've got a green top and a blue one laid out on the
bed and I cannot make up my mind.

00:00:07.798 --> 00:00:11.884
Anyway – I'm meeting Priya and Sam later, it's nothing
big, just drinks.

00:00:13.084 --> 00:00:15.812
Before you say anything – I know.

00:00:15.812 --> 00:00:16.880
First day tomorrow.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:21.768
But it's literally just a couple of hours, I'll be
home by eleven, and it's not like I need to be sharp

00:00:21.768 --> 00:00:23.429
for the first day, right?

00:00:23.429 --> 00:00:24.729
It's just orientation.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.294
They're not going to throw me in the deep end on day
one.

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:32.489
Oh – and that thing on the table, that's the information
pack they sent.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.312
Haven't had a chance to look at it yet.

00:00:34.312 --> 00:00:36.157
So – green top or blue?